WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:27.960
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:42.440 --> 01:44.240
Useless thing!

01:46.400 --> 01:48.760
Where has he been?
How did he end up so drunk?

01:48.840 --> 01:50.640
Lady Bai, don't blame him.

01:50.720 --> 01:53.160
Today, he invited Master Zheng
and asked me to join,

01:53.240 --> 01:54.840
but Master Zheng didn't show.

01:54.920 --> 01:57.720
He felt bad about it.
That's why he drank too much.

01:57.800 --> 02:00.680
Yuanxiang, we're from the same hometown.

02:00.760 --> 02:03.600
Since coming to Yangzhou,
I've helped you quite a bit.

02:04.120 --> 02:07.320
From now on,
if Mu takes you out on tasks again,

02:07.400 --> 02:08.639
let me know in advance.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.840
I understand, Lady Bai.

02:14.920 --> 02:16.800
It's late. You should head back early.

02:17.920 --> 02:20.440
Then, I'll take my leave. Rest well.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.480
It hurts!

02:37.000 --> 02:38.200
You're hitting me hard.

02:38.720 --> 02:40.760
Yuanxiang only performs.
She doesn't sell herself.

02:40.840 --> 02:43.080
Sending her to pour drinks,
you're putting her at risk!

02:43.160 --> 02:45.800
A songstress shouldn't only perform.

02:45.880 --> 02:48.960
She even dreams of marrying me,
but does she know her place?

02:49.040 --> 02:50.360
Such a hassle.

02:50.880 --> 02:52.440
Stop making indirect jabs at me.

02:53.520 --> 02:56.720
My dear sister,
I didn't mean it like that.

02:56.800 --> 02:58.080
Don't overthink, alright?

02:59.920 --> 03:00.800
You have no sense of manners.

03:09.280 --> 03:11.280
Even though Master Zheng
didn't come today,

03:11.360 --> 03:12.800
I still picked up some news.

03:13.560 --> 03:18.880
Zheng Wu seized the Zhenlang Pavilion back
and gifted it to his lover, Cui Shijiu.

03:18.960 --> 03:22.800
Working with the Zhengs
is like trying to get blood from a stone.

03:22.880 --> 03:25.040
Well, the blood has been taken!

03:25.560 --> 03:27.480
The Zheng family is too complex.

03:28.000 --> 03:31.120
Take Zheng Si. He's a legitimate son

03:31.640 --> 03:33.600
and yet they just cast him aside.

03:33.680 --> 03:34.920
So, what do you suggest?

03:35.760 --> 03:37.280
Given the current situation,

03:37.360 --> 03:39.600
if we want to make a fortune,
we can't be too cautious.

03:39.680 --> 03:41.720
The Zheng family is vast and wealthy.

03:42.240 --> 03:45.320
Whatever slips through their fingers
would be enough to secure my future.

03:45.400 --> 03:50.320
For me to rise as a guild director,
who else would I rely on but the Zhengs?

03:51.200 --> 03:54.280
-Depend on your boyfriend?
-You're rambling nonsense again.

04:01.480 --> 04:03.560
Father, Mother.

04:09.000 --> 04:11.040
You're so generous,

04:11.560 --> 04:13.680
spending a fortune
to buy Zhenlang Pavilion

04:13.760 --> 04:15.080
just to give it to Cui Shijiu.

04:15.160 --> 04:17.720
Do you even care about the Zheng family?

04:17.800 --> 04:19.040
Father, calm down.

04:19.560 --> 04:21.120
I did this for the Zheng family,

04:21.200 --> 04:23.280
by entrusting Zhenlang Pavilion
to Cui Shijiu.

04:26.480 --> 04:29.840
Zheng Wu,
stop keeping secrets from your father.

04:29.920 --> 04:32.280
Just say what you need to say.

04:32.360 --> 04:34.760
Cui Shijiu has been exposed
to jewels since childhood.

04:34.840 --> 04:38.600
Transforming jewels is her specialty.

04:48.840 --> 04:52.000
Yu, you two, step outside for a moment.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.120
Father.

05:16.720 --> 05:17.760
Continue.

05:17.840 --> 05:20.000
Now that Zhang Jinran keeps investigating,

05:20.080 --> 05:24.000
if we hold onto that batch of goods,
it's bound to bring trouble eventually.

05:24.600 --> 05:28.120
But if we let Cui Shijiu
manage Zhenlang Pavilion,

05:28.200 --> 05:31.280
she can disguise that batch of goods
and sell them off.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.480
By that time,

05:34.000 --> 05:37.200
you can truly rest easy.

05:37.280 --> 05:39.440
If any slip-up occurs,

05:40.440 --> 05:42.800
Zhenlang Pavilion
belongs to the Cui family…

05:42.880 --> 05:45.000
It has nothing to do with the Zhengs.

06:05.320 --> 06:06.320
Mother!

06:11.040 --> 06:11.920
Come with me.

06:13.680 --> 06:16.440
Are you saying you're using Cui Shijiu?

06:16.520 --> 06:17.840
Is this for real?

06:18.360 --> 06:19.760
Of course it's real.

06:19.840 --> 06:21.320
Mother, you know full well

06:21.400 --> 06:23.400
Cui Shijiu has looked down on me
since childhood.

06:23.480 --> 06:26.640
If I didn't need to use her,
why would I keep her by my side?

06:28.400 --> 06:30.560
You might fool your father,
but you can't fool me.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.560
I'm not lying to you.

06:32.640 --> 06:34.000
You have feelings for her,

06:34.080 --> 06:36.480
so you brought her back,
always protecting her.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.960
But her?
She has no genuine feelings for you.

06:39.040 --> 06:41.160
Her loyalty lies entirely
with the Cui family.

06:42.440 --> 06:43.800
Mother, don't worry.

06:43.880 --> 06:46.320
I have everything under control.

06:46.840 --> 06:49.200
Besides, as for Shijiu…

06:49.280 --> 06:51.520
Don't bring up Cui Shijiu to me.
I don't want to hear about her.

06:53.240 --> 06:54.960
I just feel sorry for you.

06:55.040 --> 06:59.320
You've given so much to her,
yet she shows no real affection in return.

06:59.400 --> 07:01.080
What do you see in her?

07:11.400 --> 07:13.800
ZHENLANG PAVILION

07:21.360 --> 07:26.240
CLEAR MIND

07:30.760 --> 07:33.760
Why aren't you looking for Yan Zijing
and just wandering around my shop?

07:33.840 --> 07:38.000
You have your principles,
but Clear Mind is nothing special.

07:38.880 --> 07:40.520
I use my methods,

07:40.600 --> 07:43.000
and now Zhenlang Pavilion
bears the Cui name again.

07:53.800 --> 07:56.840
I will never forget who my enemies are.

07:57.600 --> 07:59.840
If there's something I want,

08:00.360 --> 08:03.520
no matter the cost, I will get it.

08:06.760 --> 08:08.080
Wonderful.

08:08.160 --> 08:09.480
Su Muzhe,

08:10.280 --> 08:12.280
we're rivals once more.

09:58.760 --> 09:59.920
My lady!

10:00.000 --> 10:02.000
Oh, all you guys are here!

10:03.520 --> 10:06.720
-Look at her hairpin!
-Yingtao, what brings you here?

10:10.400 --> 10:11.760
It's too heavy for my head.

10:11.840 --> 10:13.920
Lady, here's the thing.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.480
Ms. Su asked me
to deliver this month's payment.

10:16.560 --> 10:17.480
At least she keeps her word.

10:21.320 --> 10:25.200
Yingtao, what kind of hairpin
is that on your head?

10:25.280 --> 10:26.280
Where did you get it?

10:26.360 --> 10:28.680
Yeah, it's so colorful. What's it made of?

10:28.760 --> 10:30.160
Guess.

10:30.240 --> 10:31.520
Just tell us.

10:31.600 --> 10:33.000
Don't keep us in suspense.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.560
It's glass, right?

10:36.240 --> 10:37.960
Lady Yan, you've got a sharp eye!

10:38.040 --> 10:39.560
Yes, it's glass.

10:39.640 --> 10:42.040
This is our new product at Clear Mind.

10:42.640 --> 10:44.640
Yingtao, isn't it quite expensive?

10:44.720 --> 10:46.400
Not at all!

10:46.480 --> 10:48.280
Ms. Su is very generous.

10:48.360 --> 10:49.400
You all wouldn't believe it.

10:49.480 --> 10:51.080
Today was the grand reopening
of Clear Mind,

10:51.160 --> 10:53.600
and people nearly broke down our doors!

10:53.680 --> 10:57.720
So many coming and going,
my head and neck are sore!

11:00.480 --> 11:03.160
If only I hadn't pulled out my shares.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.520
Exactly.

11:06.680 --> 11:11.200
Lady, why don't we talk to Ms. Su again?

11:11.280 --> 11:13.600
Maybe we don't need
to withdraw our shares.

11:13.680 --> 11:16.200
We withdrew so pitilessly.
Now we want to change our mind?

11:16.280 --> 11:17.920
Is there such an easy deal in the world?

11:19.840 --> 11:23.320
My lady, Ms. Su specifically said,

11:23.400 --> 11:25.520
when Clear Mind was struggling,

11:25.600 --> 11:29.160
it was natural for you
to worry about your savings.

11:29.240 --> 11:31.640
Now that we've reopened,

11:31.720 --> 11:36.520
if things remain prosperous,
it won't be too late to reinvest later.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.520
Really?

11:37.600 --> 11:39.600
-Did Ms. Su actually say that?
-Yes, she did!

11:39.680 --> 11:42.400
Ms. Su truly has a kind heart.

11:43.240 --> 11:46.080
We've been too thoughtless in the past.

11:47.360 --> 11:49.800
Yingtao, I can't let you
come all this way for nothing.

11:50.320 --> 11:52.360
Order a full set of glassware for me,

11:53.160 --> 11:54.440
and don't give me any discounts.

11:54.520 --> 11:56.240
I wouldn't feel right about it.

11:56.320 --> 11:58.720
Alright, I'll bring it to you in a bit!

11:58.800 --> 12:00.200
-I want a set too.
-Yes!

12:00.280 --> 12:01.240
-I want the same style as yours.
-Me too!

12:01.320 --> 12:02.440
-This set?
-Yes.

12:02.520 --> 12:03.640
-I want one set too!
-Alright.

12:04.240 --> 12:05.840
Wow!

12:05.920 --> 12:08.800
A perfect shot every time. Boring.

12:10.000 --> 12:12.520
SOLID AS GOLD

12:15.720 --> 12:18.640
At this range, it's hard to miss.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.600
Even more boring.

12:23.000 --> 12:23.960
Let's go.

12:24.560 --> 12:25.920
Mr. Zhang, you're teaming up with Ms. Su.

12:26.000 --> 12:28.200
-It's your turn.
-Alright, my turn.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.120
Nice!

12:42.680 --> 12:45.240
Master Yan, you really are a good teacher.

12:45.320 --> 12:46.560
Tonight, you should have
a few extra drinks.

12:48.120 --> 12:51.240
-Gaoshou, go ahead.
-Alright, I'm teaming up with Master Yan.

12:51.320 --> 12:53.720
-Master Yan, I'll go first then.
-Sure.

12:56.320 --> 12:57.680
Please.

12:57.760 --> 12:58.600
Playing this?

12:58.680 --> 13:00.560
We used to play this a lot as kids.

13:05.200 --> 13:06.240
You're so useless.

13:07.760 --> 13:10.600
Master Yan's team lost.
A drink as punishment.

13:11.800 --> 13:14.560
We'll accept the penalty. Pour me a drink.

13:14.640 --> 13:15.640
I'll drink in his place.

13:17.360 --> 13:19.000
-Give it to me.
-No need. It's fine.

13:19.080 --> 13:21.240
Enough, you two.
It's time for my second shot.

13:21.920 --> 13:23.680
-I drink less?
-Fine, go ahead.

13:31.640 --> 13:34.520
Mr. Zhang,
today was Clear Mind's grand opening.

13:35.120 --> 13:38.120
Why are so many young ladies
asking you to paint their miniatures?

13:38.200 --> 13:39.920
-Gaoshou's up to no good again.
-Yeah.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.840
You just love painting miniatures
for young ladies, huh?

13:52.440 --> 13:53.800
You really enjoy drawing…

13:55.560 --> 13:58.920
Such a shame!

13:59.000 --> 14:00.320
Aren't you cheating?

14:00.400 --> 14:02.120
-I'm not!
-Get back here and drink.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.960
-Your turn.
-Drink up, Mr. Zhang!

14:04.480 --> 14:05.520
Gaoshou, expert.

14:06.680 --> 14:10.600
Listen, a true master
won't be disturbed no matter what.

14:12.440 --> 14:15.720
At this distance, even being disturbed,
I can still make the shot.

14:16.720 --> 14:18.960
I trust Master Yan.
I'll fetch you an arrow!

14:23.240 --> 14:24.080
Catch, please.

14:25.440 --> 14:28.240
-Alright, I'll shoot from right here.
-If Master Yan's playing,

14:28.760 --> 14:32.520
the rules of the game should change,
or it won't be fair, right?

14:32.600 --> 14:34.240
-Here, grab the arrow.
-So, how should it be fair?

14:34.920 --> 14:37.680
-You shoot with your eyes covered by me.
-That's a good idea!

14:37.760 --> 14:39.480
-I agree.
-Yes, indeed.

14:40.000 --> 14:41.760
-I agree!
-So, this is your idea of fairness?

14:41.840 --> 14:42.800
Is that fair?

14:42.880 --> 14:44.320
Of course it's fair. Get ready.

14:45.040 --> 14:46.080
Ready?

14:47.280 --> 14:48.240
Aim a bit to the left.

14:48.320 --> 14:49.800
I won't listen to you.
You're giving bad directions.

14:49.880 --> 14:51.760
-Trust me.
-I don't trust you.

14:51.840 --> 14:53.200
Fine, then go ahead.

14:55.120 --> 14:58.000
Three, two, one!

15:01.680 --> 15:03.680
-Nice!
-Perfect!

15:03.760 --> 15:06.000
-Master Yan truly has amazing skills!
-Great shot!

15:06.680 --> 15:07.520
Impressive!

15:07.600 --> 15:08.960
Just a small feat.

15:16.160 --> 15:17.520
-Come on.
-Drink up, Master Yan.

15:17.600 --> 15:18.720
Sure, come on!

15:18.800 --> 15:21.040
Excellent shot!
Let's have a toast together!

15:21.120 --> 15:23.400
Today, our Clear Mind glassware
sold so well.

15:23.480 --> 15:25.720
May we have success like this
every year and day.

15:25.800 --> 15:26.840
-Well said!
-Cheers!

15:26.920 --> 15:28.040
-Here, cheers!
-Cheers!

16:00.840 --> 16:03.280
Mr. Xu, Father.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.280
Father…

16:09.880 --> 16:12.680
Mr. Xu is one of us. Speak freely.

16:13.880 --> 16:16.040
It's merely some business trifles,

16:16.120 --> 16:17.880
but I feared it might disrupt
Mr. Xu's leisure.

16:17.960 --> 16:18.880
No bother.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.440
Go ahead. What is it?

16:20.520 --> 16:24.040
Su Muzhe of Clear Mind
has started selling glass as well.

16:24.120 --> 16:27.160
The same batch
from the old Qin's Glass Workshop.

16:27.680 --> 16:28.760
Qin?

16:30.400 --> 16:32.440
-He hasn't left Yangzhou yet?
-Not yet.

16:34.000 --> 16:36.720
And what's this about the glass?

16:36.800 --> 16:40.720
That Qin once dared
to produce substandard glass

16:40.800 --> 16:43.000
and tried to challenge my Jubao House,

16:43.080 --> 16:45.600
disrupting the operations
of Yangzhou's jewelry shops.

16:45.680 --> 16:47.880
So, I taught him a small lesson.

16:47.960 --> 16:50.720
If it's defective, it should
be expelled from Yangzhou.

16:50.800 --> 16:52.640
Yes.

16:52.720 --> 16:55.280
And now, Su Muzhe from Clear Mind

16:55.360 --> 16:58.040
is bringing out that batch
of defective glass

16:58.120 --> 16:59.440
to stir up trouble.

16:59.520 --> 17:00.960
Stir up trouble?

17:01.040 --> 17:05.520
It's just some glass.
How could it trouble our Mr. Zheng?

17:09.400 --> 17:14.319
Go buy the land deed of Clear Mind
and drive them out of Yangzhou.

17:14.400 --> 17:15.280
Father,

17:15.359 --> 17:18.440
that land deed for Clear Mind
has already been purchased by Su Muzhe.

17:18.520 --> 17:20.680
Then make sure
they can't stay in business.

17:21.400 --> 17:25.040
With Mr. Xu backing us,
what is there to worry about?

17:25.640 --> 17:27.040
Yes, Father.

17:33.080 --> 17:37.480
In the future, we hope Mr. Xu
will uphold justice for us.

17:37.560 --> 17:41.760
A mere shop like Clear Mind
is hardly an issue.

17:48.480 --> 17:51.320
Are you really that happy?

17:55.920 --> 17:57.520
Did you drink too much?

18:07.720 --> 18:09.760
Why is there no moon tonight?

18:10.920 --> 18:12.720
It's covered by clouds.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.400
What's wrong?

18:26.960 --> 18:28.280
Tell me.

18:33.840 --> 18:35.120
Do you hate me?

18:44.320 --> 18:45.600
Why are you laughing?

18:45.680 --> 18:47.840
If I say I've never hated you,

18:50.160 --> 18:51.000
would you believe me?

18:55.200 --> 18:56.040
I wouldn't.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.440
I don't hate you.

19:02.680 --> 19:04.160
I only hate myself.

19:06.800 --> 19:08.760
If only I hadn't insisted
on following you,

19:09.360 --> 19:10.760
they'd all still be alive.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.720
What reason do I have to hate you?

19:20.640 --> 19:21.880
In the end,

19:24.640 --> 19:25.760
it's all my fault.

19:27.080 --> 19:28.880
I have been consumed by vengeance.

19:31.600 --> 19:32.640
It's not your fault.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.720
You did nothing wrong.

19:34.800 --> 19:37.000
The mistake lies in our birth.

19:37.640 --> 19:39.560
The mistake is in the things
we can't change.

19:42.520 --> 19:44.280
That's why I wonder.

19:47.040 --> 19:48.840
If we hadn't gone through this,

19:48.920 --> 19:50.960
would the outcome be different?

19:53.560 --> 19:54.800
Would you and me…

20:01.320 --> 20:02.600
be different as well?

20:03.320 --> 20:04.880
If you could do it all over again,

20:08.520 --> 20:10.000
would you still want to know me?

21:37.480 --> 21:38.320
CLEAR MIND

21:38.400 --> 21:40.560
Su Muzhe, get out here!

21:41.720 --> 21:45.120
You know what?
Clear Mind is selling toxic glassware!

21:45.200 --> 21:47.960
Songstress Yuanxiang
wore it for barely two days,

21:48.040 --> 21:49.600
and now she's on the brink.

21:49.680 --> 21:53.440
So, who's the heartless one?
Who's playing with people's lives?

21:53.520 --> 21:55.320
Now you can't face the consequences, huh?

21:55.400 --> 21:57.200
You're too scared to come out, huh?

21:57.280 --> 21:59.000
Get out here!

21:59.080 --> 22:00.120
So noisy.

22:00.200 --> 22:02.920
It's not your place to speak.
Bring out the one responsible!

22:03.000 --> 22:04.760
-Are you too ashamed
-How can you stay so calm?

22:04.840 --> 22:05.680
to show your face, huh?

22:05.760 --> 22:07.560
Shut up already. That's enough.

22:07.640 --> 22:10.200
You're not worthy of speaking to me.
Call out the one in charge! Come out!

22:10.280 --> 22:11.320
-I wasn't talking to you.
-What's the problem?

22:11.400 --> 22:13.320
Why are you even here, Qin?

22:13.400 --> 22:14.800
Why am I here?

22:14.880 --> 22:17.440
Even if Lady Yuanxiang
has a health problem,

22:17.520 --> 22:19.080
what does it matter to you?

22:19.920 --> 22:21.680
I'm here to fight injustice!

22:21.760 --> 22:23.600
But you,

22:23.680 --> 22:25.880
you took my money to smash Clear Mind,

22:25.960 --> 22:28.080
and now you're working here?

22:28.160 --> 22:30.600
Aren't you ashamed? Double-dealing coward.

22:30.680 --> 22:31.720
How dare you stand here?

22:31.800 --> 22:35.080
-You're unworthy! Get out of my way!
-That's right!

22:35.160 --> 22:38.360
I took your money and smashed Clear Mind.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.640
I admit it!

22:39.720 --> 22:41.800
I'm a man who takes responsibility
for his actions.

22:41.880 --> 22:43.720
I accept my fault, and I correct it.

22:43.800 --> 22:44.760
What's the problem?

22:44.840 --> 22:46.480
But you, foolish as you are,

22:46.560 --> 22:48.200
I knew you wouldn't let this go.

22:48.280 --> 22:49.560
I didn't think you'd actually
dare to come here!

22:49.640 --> 22:50.840
-Why wouldn't I?
-Where did you get the nerve?

22:50.920 --> 22:52.160
I'm telling you, I'm doing what's right!

22:52.240 --> 22:53.680
-Don't…
-Gaoshou.

22:55.680 --> 22:57.000
So, Mr. Qin, you're finally admitting

22:57.080 --> 22:59.000
that you once paid people
to smash our Clear Mind?

22:59.840 --> 23:01.680
If it weren't for Gaoshou's insight,

23:01.760 --> 23:04.320
Clear Mind would have long fallen
to your disgraceful tactics.

23:04.400 --> 23:05.280
Disgraceful.

23:05.360 --> 23:07.240
-What's this new stunt?
-I'm leaving.

23:07.320 --> 23:09.720
Trying to slander Clear Mind again?

23:09.800 --> 23:10.800
Slander?

23:10.880 --> 23:12.520
You've always resented Clear Mind.

23:12.600 --> 23:15.120
Who would believe you?

23:15.200 --> 23:16.400
Who would?

23:17.040 --> 23:18.320
Competitors are rivals,

23:18.400 --> 23:20.480
-stirring up trouble every other day.
-Exactly.

23:20.560 --> 23:23.800
But are you just going to let them
smear Clear Mind's name?

23:23.880 --> 23:25.440
Sometimes things have to break
to be rebuilt.

23:26.800 --> 23:28.960
Sooner or later,
Clear Mind would face this.

23:29.560 --> 23:30.800
The one who should come isn't here yet.

23:42.280 --> 23:43.600
Since you're free,

23:43.680 --> 23:45.440
why not help me settle some accounts?

23:48.880 --> 23:49.800
Fine.

24:01.480 --> 24:02.720
On the sixth of March,

24:03.840 --> 24:06.160
old jewels, 19 taels.

24:07.920 --> 24:09.240
Lady, these jewels are beautiful.

24:09.320 --> 24:10.520
-Yes, indeed.
-Trouble's come!

24:10.600 --> 24:13.840
Qin Mu brought Yuanxiang
to Clear Mind, causing a scene.

24:13.920 --> 24:16.240
He said Clear Mind's
glass jewelry is toxic.

24:16.320 --> 24:18.680
I heard Yuanxiang's face
is covered in red rashes,

24:18.760 --> 24:19.720
completely disfigured!

24:20.520 --> 24:22.640
-Are there any on my face?
-No, there aren't.

24:22.720 --> 24:25.680
Don't jump to conclusions.
Let's go see for ourselves first.

24:25.760 --> 24:27.840
-Alright, let's go.
-Okay.

24:28.920 --> 24:30.160
Don't you believe it?

24:30.680 --> 24:33.080
Everyone, take a look!
The evidence is right here!

24:33.160 --> 24:34.320
She's covered in red rashes.

24:34.400 --> 24:36.080
-More breaths going out than coming in.
-Move aside.

24:36.160 --> 24:37.280
-Move aside.
-It's all because

24:37.360 --> 24:38.360
-of Clear Mind's toxic glass!
-Move aside.

24:38.440 --> 24:40.560
Look, she's barely hanging on!

24:40.640 --> 24:42.240
-So pitiful, isn't she?
-My god.

24:42.320 --> 24:44.040
Yuanxiang is in bad health

24:44.120 --> 24:45.680
-and still hasn't seen a doctor?
-Shout it out!

24:45.760 --> 24:47.360
-Something seems off.
-Clear Mind sells toxic glassware!

24:47.440 --> 24:48.640
Su Muzhe, come out!

24:48.720 --> 24:50.640
Shout it. Clear Mind
sells toxic glassware!

24:50.720 --> 24:51.840
Su Muzhe, get out here!

24:51.920 --> 24:55.120
Clear Mind sells toxic glassware!
Su Muzhe, come out here!

24:55.200 --> 24:56.280
Not coming out, huh?

24:56.360 --> 24:57.880
Hiding like a coward, huh?

24:57.960 --> 24:59.480
Then don't blame me

25:00.000 --> 25:02.000
if I have to come in
and smash up your store!

25:02.080 --> 25:02.920
-Get out of my way!
-What are you doing?

25:03.000 --> 25:03.880
-Move aside.
-What are you going to do?

25:03.960 --> 25:05.440
-Don't touch me! I don't want to…
-You're daring to smash our store?

25:05.520 --> 25:06.720
This is too much!

25:08.440 --> 25:10.640
If Yuanxiang's poisoned,
report it to the authorities.

25:10.720 --> 25:13.200
Causing a fuss here without any proof,
what's the point?

25:13.280 --> 25:15.320
Don't block my way, or I'll hit you too!

25:15.400 --> 25:16.240
-I'm warning you…
-You dare?

25:16.320 --> 25:17.360
Go ahead. Hit us and see!

25:17.440 --> 25:18.520
If you attack innocent citizens,

25:18.600 --> 25:19.960
we'll report it
to the authorities right now!

25:20.040 --> 25:21.040
-Exactly!
-Go on. Hit us and see!

25:21.120 --> 25:24.160
With all these people watching,
hit me first. Go ahead!

25:24.240 --> 25:24.840
-Try it!
-Hit us!

25:24.920 --> 25:25.480
-Go ahead!
-All together now!

25:25.560 --> 25:27.120
-Do it. Hit us!
-Hit us!

25:27.200 --> 25:28.400
Go on. Hit us!

25:28.480 --> 25:30.680
Hey, you have no ties
to Clear Mind anymore.

25:30.760 --> 25:31.880
You have no shares here.

25:31.960 --> 25:33.200
So, why are you meddling in this?

25:33.280 --> 25:36.400
Things need to be made clear.
Ms. Su would never do something like this!

25:36.480 --> 25:37.880
I… I don't want to argue with you all.

25:37.960 --> 25:38.840
Step aside!

25:38.920 --> 25:41.120
-What are you doing?
-Step back!

25:41.200 --> 25:42.120
-Get out of the way!
-Get out of the way!

25:42.200 --> 25:43.400
-Move aside!
-You, move aside!

25:45.000 --> 25:46.080
Someone reported to the authorities,

25:47.240 --> 25:50.440
claiming there's
a murder case at Clear Mind.

25:52.120 --> 25:53.200
Did you file the report?

25:58.600 --> 25:59.480
The main party has arrived.

26:02.600 --> 26:04.320
Then we must go meet them.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.080
What about April?

26:09.480 --> 26:10.760
April,

26:11.400 --> 26:14.400
old jewels, seven taels and five.

26:17.640 --> 26:19.160
That fool!

26:19.240 --> 26:22.680
He's no good on his own,
always trying these underhanded tricks.

26:22.760 --> 26:24.560
Could the Zheng family
be easy to deal with?

26:24.640 --> 26:26.400
He's obsessed
with becoming a guild director

26:26.480 --> 26:27.960
and doesn't even realize
he's being played.

26:28.040 --> 26:29.280
I heard Mr. Xu went over too.

26:29.360 --> 26:31.040
With Mr. Xu backing him,
it should be fine.

26:31.680 --> 26:33.520
No, I still need to go check.

26:39.880 --> 26:40.720
Oh…

26:41.360 --> 26:43.480
Quick, go notify Mr. Xu immediately.

26:43.560 --> 26:44.920
Or else, it'll be the end of everything.

26:59.080 --> 27:00.880
Greetings, Inspector Zhang.

27:01.760 --> 27:03.880
Baicaojing House
has always obeyed the law.

27:03.960 --> 27:06.960
You suddenly bring people here.
May I ask for what reason?

27:09.160 --> 27:10.040
Let's go!

27:14.200 --> 27:16.160
Inspector Zhang has ordered
that no one is to leave.

27:18.040 --> 27:20.400
Qin Mu tried to frame Clear Mind
with a poison box.

27:21.240 --> 27:22.600
Is that what you call obeying the law?

27:24.600 --> 27:27.720
Search carefully!
Don't miss a single spot!

27:27.800 --> 27:28.760
Yes, sir!

27:44.760 --> 27:46.480
What do you mean, Lady Bai?

27:46.560 --> 27:47.680
Inspector Zhang,

27:47.760 --> 27:51.320
you came to Baicaojing House
to look for some poison box, didn't you?

27:51.400 --> 27:54.640
So, why are you
suddenly going through our jewelry?

27:54.720 --> 27:56.200
Open it!

28:01.000 --> 28:03.800
I came here to find the poison box,

28:05.040 --> 28:06.880
but I didn't expect to be so astonished.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.280
Lady Bai,

28:11.200 --> 28:12.600
do you recognize this chest of jewels?

28:14.680 --> 28:17.040
These are jewels from Zhenlang Pavilion.

28:17.120 --> 28:18.960
So, why are they here at Baicaojing House?

28:20.080 --> 28:21.560
Perhaps…

28:22.800 --> 28:24.640
Perhaps there's a traitor within.

28:25.320 --> 28:28.520
Is it really an inside traitor,
or is there another reason?

28:29.720 --> 28:31.720
Come with me,
and we'll find out soon enough.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.400
Mr. Xu, look.

28:36.480 --> 28:38.400
Yuanxiang's life is in grave danger.

28:38.480 --> 28:40.400
You must stand up for us, Mr. Xu!

28:40.920 --> 28:42.680
What exactly is going on here?

28:43.320 --> 28:45.280
They're selling toxic glassware
at Clear Mind.

28:45.360 --> 28:46.920
She fell ill two days after wearing it.

28:47.000 --> 28:48.120
Please, see for yourself.

28:48.200 --> 28:49.800
You must bring justice to us.

28:51.040 --> 28:53.360
ZHENLANG PAVILION

28:56.240 --> 29:00.240
Clear Mind is suspected
of selling toxic glassware,

29:00.320 --> 29:02.080
endangering the citizens of Yangzhou.

29:02.160 --> 29:05.880
I hereby order the store to be sealed
and the toxic glassware seized.

29:05.960 --> 29:09.040
Anyone resisting
will be dealt with by the law.

29:09.120 --> 29:10.120
Yes, arrest them according to the law!

29:10.200 --> 29:11.760
-Yes, sir!
-Wait!

29:11.840 --> 29:12.680
Oh…

29:13.280 --> 29:14.760
What's going on?

29:16.440 --> 29:17.880
What's happening?

29:19.680 --> 29:21.160
Mr. Xu!

29:22.760 --> 29:23.880
Greetings.

29:25.640 --> 29:28.280
Ms. Su, long time no see.

29:28.360 --> 29:30.080
You seem to be in good spirits lately.

29:30.160 --> 29:33.240
It appears that tonics
do benefit the health.

29:34.320 --> 29:37.640
After today, I may feel even better.

29:37.720 --> 29:39.600
That remains to be seen.

29:39.680 --> 29:42.840
Mr. Xu, Lady Yuanxiang's condition
is critical.

29:42.920 --> 29:44.080
If it turns out
to be a fault of Clear Mind,

29:44.160 --> 29:45.520
I will take full responsibility.

29:45.600 --> 29:46.600
However,

29:47.600 --> 29:50.120
let's get her to the clinic first.
What do you say?

29:50.720 --> 29:52.600
Ms. Su, you have a compassionate heart.

29:52.680 --> 29:54.320
Let's proceed as you suggest.

29:54.920 --> 29:56.120
I'll trouble you ladies with the task.

29:56.200 --> 29:57.600
Rest assured.

29:58.960 --> 30:00.520
-We've clarified the matter!
-Move aside!

30:00.600 --> 30:01.840
No one is allowed to leave! No!

30:02.440 --> 30:04.880
Once Lady Yuanxiang
is taken to the clinic,

30:05.400 --> 30:10.040
we'll soon find out
the source of this poison.

30:10.120 --> 30:13.400
Mr. Xu, Clear Mind is so malicious,
treating lives as nothing.

30:13.480 --> 30:14.800
You must stand up for us!

30:14.880 --> 30:18.000
Clear Mind has sold
hundreds of glass hairpins,

30:18.080 --> 30:19.600
and I've carefully examined each one.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.440
I've never heard of anyone being poisoned.

30:21.960 --> 30:25.280
You claim Yuanxiang was poisoned
by a glass hairpin from Clear Mind.

30:25.360 --> 30:27.960
Then where is this toxic glassware now?

30:28.840 --> 30:29.680
Show it!

30:39.640 --> 30:42.520
This is indeed from Clear Mind.
It has our mark on the base.

30:43.120 --> 30:46.360
So, it's all come to light, hasn't it?
Mr. Xu, the evidence is clear.

30:46.440 --> 30:48.040
Since that's the case,

30:48.920 --> 30:52.240
I'll trouble Ms. Su
and everyone from Clear Mind

30:52.320 --> 30:54.600
to come to my office for questioning.

30:55.120 --> 30:56.120
Mr. Xu,

30:56.200 --> 30:58.560
even in the court of law,

30:58.640 --> 31:00.160
I should be allowed
to defend myself, shouldn't I?

31:00.760 --> 31:05.200
At this point,
what is there left to argue, Ms. Su?

31:05.800 --> 31:07.240
The show's just begun.

31:07.320 --> 31:08.480
Okay.

31:22.360 --> 31:23.360
Mr. Qin…

31:25.960 --> 31:26.960
What is that?

31:27.800 --> 31:29.600
Poison pollen!

31:29.680 --> 31:30.720
Help!

31:30.800 --> 31:32.320
-Mr. Xu.
-What's wrong with you?

31:32.400 --> 31:34.880
-Look,
-Poison pollen! Bring water, quickly!

31:34.960 --> 31:37.800
How did you know
there was poison pollen inside this box?

31:38.720 --> 31:40.480
Can't I just take a guess?

31:41.200 --> 31:43.880
Mr. Xu, instead of hastily
searching our shop,

31:43.960 --> 31:45.240
why not ask Mr. Qin

31:45.320 --> 31:47.920
how he so quickly identified
this as poison pollen?

31:48.000 --> 31:50.320
First, he said our glass is toxic.

31:50.400 --> 31:53.720
Now, he says the powder
in this box is poisonous.

31:54.400 --> 31:57.320
Mr. Qin, what's really going on here?

32:08.480 --> 32:09.520
Mr. Xu,

32:10.200 --> 32:11.440
it seems

32:12.200 --> 32:14.520
this was all a misunderstanding.

32:14.600 --> 32:16.600
You jumped to conclusions,

32:16.680 --> 32:19.640
claiming there's a murder case
tied to Clear Mind.

32:19.720 --> 32:21.680
Is that something to joke about?

32:23.080 --> 32:26.120
Now, shouldn't you apologize to Ms. Su?

32:28.360 --> 32:29.440
Well…

32:30.560 --> 32:32.040
-This is slander!
-Indeed!

32:37.240 --> 32:40.600
Ms. Su, this was a misunderstanding.
Please be forgiving.

32:41.280 --> 32:42.440
Mr. Xu,

32:43.800 --> 32:46.080
it's no easy task for us
to run a business.

32:47.120 --> 32:51.640
Especially,
since Lady Yuanxiang's life is at stake.

32:51.720 --> 32:55.240
Calling this a "misunderstanding"
isn't too light?

32:55.840 --> 32:58.520
Moreover, the citizens of this city

32:58.600 --> 33:00.320
now believe Clear Mind
sells toxic glassware.

33:00.400 --> 33:02.640
How am I supposed
to do business from now on?

33:03.160 --> 33:05.560
If you ask me, I won't stand for it.

33:06.080 --> 33:09.680
Let's settle today's matter
right here and now.

33:09.760 --> 33:10.720
Yes!

33:10.800 --> 33:13.440
Recently, Clear Mind ordered
500 decorative boxes.

33:13.520 --> 33:16.360
It turns out these boxes
were laced with oleander pollen.

33:16.440 --> 33:20.080
Ms. Su had that batch sealed up long ago,
not a single one leaking out.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.880
What's in these boxes now

33:21.960 --> 33:24.560
is merely our specially
crafted fragrance powder,

33:25.160 --> 33:26.000
completely harmless.

33:26.600 --> 33:31.960
And the box merchant confessed
it was Qin Mu who paid people to do it.

33:32.040 --> 33:33.440
You're telling lies!

33:33.960 --> 33:34.960
Where's the proof?

33:35.040 --> 33:37.520
We have it! Please have a look.

33:37.600 --> 33:38.640
Mr. Xu.

33:48.800 --> 33:49.920
Mr. Xu.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.800
It appears

33:54.760 --> 33:59.240
there's quite a story between Mr. Qin
and this box merchant.

33:59.320 --> 34:02.760
Guards, take Mr. Qin into custody!

34:02.840 --> 34:04.600
-Mr. Xu, I…
-Take him away!

34:05.480 --> 34:06.320
Move!

34:10.400 --> 34:13.960
Ms. Su, today's events
were purely a misunderstanding.

34:14.040 --> 34:15.000
Sorry for the disturbance.

34:15.080 --> 34:17.639
I have other pressing matters,
so I'll take my leave.

34:18.159 --> 34:20.800
Mr. Xu, it's rare for you
to visit Clear Mind,

34:20.880 --> 34:23.480
and I also have important matters
to discuss with you.

34:25.800 --> 34:29.639
Ms. Su, feel free to speak plainly.

34:35.800 --> 34:39.880
This fool Qin Mu
is Bai Niao's younger brother.

34:40.480 --> 34:42.840
Given the relationship
between Bai Niao and you,

34:46.600 --> 34:50.880
protecting her foolish brother
must have been taxing.

34:50.960 --> 34:54.679
My connection with Lady Bai
is merely a passing affair.

34:55.199 --> 34:59.960
If you have nothing further to say,
then I shall take my leave.

35:00.640 --> 35:03.560
Whatever Baicaojing House can do for you,

35:04.880 --> 35:06.840
Clear Mind can assist with as well.

35:09.480 --> 35:11.040
It seems you start understanding

35:11.120 --> 35:13.520
the challenges
of doing business in Yangzhou.

35:14.040 --> 35:15.560
Looking for new support?

35:16.440 --> 35:18.280
Conducting business in Yangzhou

35:19.360 --> 35:20.960
naturally requires some protection.

35:22.520 --> 35:24.920
Providing protection isn't an issue.

35:25.000 --> 35:28.880
I only care about your token of loyalty.

35:36.360 --> 35:37.400
Yingtao,

35:38.240 --> 35:39.160
prepare the tea.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.280
Xu Nanying!

35:45.040 --> 35:46.680
Seems we won't need to talk at all.

35:54.400 --> 35:56.360
CLEAR MIND

35:56.440 --> 35:58.920
When you took office,
you came with little attention.

35:59.000 --> 36:01.360
In less than half a year,

36:01.440 --> 36:04.560
how did you accumulate
a fortune at Baicaojing House?

36:05.200 --> 36:06.600
You've been investigating me secretly?

36:06.680 --> 36:09.040
I have the authority to inspect anyone.

36:09.880 --> 36:11.840
-Take him away!
-No need.

36:17.840 --> 36:19.760
You've schemed for so long.

36:19.840 --> 36:20.800
Jinran,

36:21.480 --> 36:23.480
wherever you're taking me,

36:24.240 --> 36:27.560
I will follow you.

36:45.520 --> 36:47.240
-Duanwu.
-That's wonderful!

36:49.560 --> 36:51.000
Seventeen thousand…

36:52.400 --> 36:53.480
It's like this.

36:57.280 --> 36:58.160
Ladies.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.120
Ms. Su!

37:02.880 --> 37:05.440
Ms. Su, the ladies
have been waiting outside for a while,

37:05.520 --> 37:07.120
so I invited them in.

37:11.880 --> 37:13.600
That scoundrel Qin Mu

37:13.680 --> 37:15.440
tricked Yuanxiang
into thinking he'd marry her,

37:15.520 --> 37:16.760
just to use her to frame you.

37:16.840 --> 37:20.520
Today, it nearly cost you everything.

37:20.600 --> 37:23.600
Thankfully, you held no grudges,
sent Yuanxiang for treatment in time,

37:23.680 --> 37:25.080
and even covered her medical fees.

37:25.160 --> 37:27.760
Yes, she's lucky to be alive.

37:27.840 --> 37:29.680
She's filled with regret now

37:29.760 --> 37:32.120
and sent us to thank you personally.

37:33.240 --> 37:35.000
We all live in this world

37:36.040 --> 37:39.480
with no parents to pamper us,
no brothers to protect us,

37:40.120 --> 37:41.560
like floating duckweed.

37:44.720 --> 37:47.880
But when duckweed gathers together,
supporting each other,

37:48.920 --> 37:50.480
it won't drift aimlessly.

37:50.560 --> 37:52.280
Regarding the toxic glassware affair,

37:52.360 --> 37:55.640
I never imagined
you all would come to my aid.

37:56.840 --> 37:57.760
Thank you.

37:59.680 --> 38:00.840
Ms. Su,

38:01.440 --> 38:06.640
we were timid and foolish before
and backed out of our shares.

38:06.720 --> 38:09.000
Later, when you were framed,

38:09.080 --> 38:12.920
we stayed on the sidelines,
watching indifferently.

38:13.520 --> 38:15.640
But after what happened with Yuanxiang,

38:15.720 --> 38:19.120
we finally understand
the good and evil in people's hearts.

38:19.720 --> 38:20.800
In short,

38:21.320 --> 38:26.440
we now see clearly that you are someone
who's kindhearted, loyal, and righteous.

38:26.520 --> 38:29.360
Today, we came not just to thank you,

38:31.240 --> 38:32.640
but to apologize too.

38:45.080 --> 38:46.160
Then…

38:47.240 --> 38:48.680
we'll take our leave.

38:51.280 --> 38:52.360
Wait.

38:57.000 --> 39:00.160
In truth, we're all the same,
without any support in this world.

39:01.040 --> 39:02.320
But I've been thinking.

39:03.920 --> 39:06.800
If women could rely on one another,

39:09.280 --> 39:10.880
then perhaps there
wouldn't be another Yuanxiang.

39:12.480 --> 39:13.760
There's something

39:14.720 --> 39:16.840
I need the opinion of you on.

39:18.880 --> 39:22.000
I want to establish
the Duckweed Society within Clear Mind.

39:22.880 --> 39:26.000
From now on, we'll set aside
10% of our profits

39:26.080 --> 39:27.200
and add

39:28.240 --> 39:29.880
Lady Huan's former shares to it,

39:31.160 --> 39:37.000
to help women in Yangzhou
who, like us, have no one to rely on.

39:39.720 --> 39:40.560
How about it?

39:42.920 --> 39:43.960
With the Duckweed Society,

39:44.040 --> 39:46.760
our hearts and efforts

39:47.520 --> 39:48.960
will be united.

39:49.640 --> 39:52.800
We'll finally have a place to call home.

39:53.400 --> 39:54.320
So,

39:56.160 --> 39:57.440
are you interested
in rejoining as shareholders?

40:01.960 --> 40:02.920
Yes.

40:04.480 --> 40:06.800
This time, no more backing out!

40:06.880 --> 40:08.080
Absolutely not.

40:08.160 --> 40:11.520
Even if we lose money in the future,
we believe

40:11.600 --> 40:15.000
with Ms. Su here,
and all of us working together,

40:15.080 --> 40:16.520
there's no obstacle we can't overcome.

40:18.360 --> 40:21.240
Alright, take a seat, everyone.
Enjoy some tea.

40:21.320 --> 40:22.680
Yingtao, get everything ready.

40:22.760 --> 40:23.600
-Come on, ladies.
-Let's go.

40:24.920 --> 40:26.440
Alright, I'll take a seat then.

40:28.240 --> 40:31.800
GRAND GOVERNOR'S OFFICE

40:31.880 --> 40:32.720
Qin Mu,

40:33.920 --> 40:38.560
you harmed the people,
then framed Clear Mind.

40:39.080 --> 40:40.280
Do you have anything to say?

40:40.360 --> 40:43.120
I'm innocent, Inspector Zhang!
I don't know anything.

40:44.120 --> 40:45.400
She made me do it!

40:45.480 --> 40:47.160
She's envious of Clear Mind's business,

40:47.240 --> 40:49.360
so she wants to take it over herself!

40:49.440 --> 40:52.440
Inspector Zhang,
I was orphaned at a young age.

40:52.520 --> 40:54.840
I fought my way up
from nothing to get here.

40:54.920 --> 40:57.480
I would never do something so despicable.

40:58.000 --> 40:59.360
Please, see the truth!

41:01.560 --> 41:02.720
Bai Niao,

41:03.640 --> 41:05.840
is what Qin Mu said true?

41:11.400 --> 41:12.880
Reporting to Inspector Zhang.

41:14.160 --> 41:16.680
What Qin Mu said is true.

41:17.800 --> 41:20.160
The poisoning was my doing alone

41:20.240 --> 41:22.280
and has nothing to do with anyone else.

41:22.360 --> 41:25.840
Exactly. It has nothing to do with me!
She did it all on her own!

41:41.640 --> 41:45.160
Today, we're sounding the drum
to seek justice for Yuanxiang!

41:45.240 --> 41:50.080
Qin Mu, in an effort to frame Clear Mind,
poisoned and harmed Yuanxiang!

41:51.280 --> 41:52.640
What a villain!

41:55.360 --> 41:56.600
Who is beating the drum here?

41:59.560 --> 42:01.200
We are the songstresses of Yangzhou.

42:01.280 --> 42:03.560
Today, we've come with a petition,

42:03.640 --> 42:06.000
requesting that Inspector Zhang
punish the evildoer severely

42:06.080 --> 42:08.160
and restore justice for Yuanxiang!

42:08.240 --> 42:10.560
Restore justice for Yuanxiang!

42:23.400 --> 42:27.000
I, Yuanxiang,
accuse Qin Mu of poisoning me

42:27.080 --> 42:30.800
and deliberately delaying
when my life was at risk,

42:30.880 --> 42:32.480
solely to ruin Clear Mind's reputation.

42:32.560 --> 42:34.160
Aren't you perfectly fine now?

42:34.760 --> 42:39.440
I see, you pretended
to be poisoned to slander Clear Mind!

42:39.520 --> 42:42.040
You heartless scoundrel!

42:42.120 --> 42:44.960
I was on the brink of death
when they sent me for treatment!

42:45.040 --> 42:47.120
The doctor at the clinic
can testify to that!

42:48.040 --> 42:50.080
You waited and waited,

42:50.160 --> 42:52.320
and when you saw
I didn't get poisoned from the glassware,

42:52.400 --> 42:54.840
you personally fed me poisoned pastries,

42:54.920 --> 42:56.520
making me suffer from the poisoning!

42:56.600 --> 42:58.000
Qin Mu,

42:58.760 --> 43:01.800
you said… you said you'd marry me,

43:03.440 --> 43:05.200
yet you intended all along to harm me.

43:05.280 --> 43:07.360
-I…
-Lies, all lies!

43:07.440 --> 43:09.600
What status do you think you have?
You're nothing but a lowly songstress!

43:09.680 --> 43:12.480
-What give you the right to marry me? Pah!
-Who are you calling lowly?

43:12.560 --> 43:14.440
It's all of you! You filthy songstresses!

43:14.520 --> 43:16.480
-Silence!
-All of you…

43:16.560 --> 43:17.600
You're the lowly one!

43:17.680 --> 43:22.240
Lady Bai, he's insulting us like this.
Why do you still cover for him?

43:24.000 --> 43:24.840
Qin Mu,

43:25.440 --> 43:27.600
you keep saying it wasn't you,

43:27.680 --> 43:29.160
it was all Bai Niao's doing.

43:29.240 --> 43:31.280
I have a confession here.

43:32.760 --> 43:33.800
CONFESSION

43:33.880 --> 43:38.200
Mr. Jia, the decorative box merchant,
can confirm that you poisoned the boxes,

43:38.280 --> 43:39.920
showing no regard for human life!

43:40.000 --> 43:43.600
With both witnesses and evidence present,
what do you have left to deny?
